        <p>There is only ore "Firit" in a ra-ce, sand 'it is acknow- ledged .aittiosit-doubt that GWILYM EVANS* QUININE BITTERS,,The Vegetable Tonic, is_The Best Reusedy of the Age for Weakness,.Nervonsness, Indigestion, Loss of Appetite, Impure Blood, Chest Affections, Low Spirits, and Influecza. This remedy of world-wide fame strengthens that part of the system which is weakest or 'sae been weakened by disease,and therefore more liable I to colds and their attendant ailments ; it purifies the blood and stimulates the circulation, assists aod pro- motes digestion, and improves the appetite. It braces the nerves and fortifies the muscles, rouses the sluggish liver, and thus enlivens the spirits ; it removes all im- purities and obstructions from the human bodr, and gives tone to the whole system. Gwilym Evaus' Quinine Bitters is purely vegetable, for the formula includes the Tonic properties of Sarsaparilla, Saffron, Gentian, Bur- dock, Lavender. and Dandalion, in addition to Quinine, and is suitable to all ages, from the infant to the adult, and confidently vcommended to those who have to devote themselves to study and brain work, to all who work long hours in close rooms, to those who breathe impure air, and all who have to stand exposure of the weather. People that suffer from brain fag and sleeplessness, who feel " out of sorts " and "run down" find rapid and permanent relief from the use of Gwilym Evans' Quinine Bitters. The occupations of some men keep their whole faculties continually at their furthest stretch, and life is lei hurry and worry. Little wonder is it that this extreme tension leads to an unusual wear and tear:of the nerves and that these hard-worked toilers require an extra sustenance for body and brain. Now, Gwilym Evans' Quinine Bitters feeds both, and men are wise if they look ahead and preserve their strength by taking this infallible feeder to all vital powers.'fhere are Ave fixed facts about this renowned preparation-Ist, used by medical profession; 2nd a purely vegetable com- pound ; 3rd, absolutely free from mercury ; 4th, tested for a quarter of a century ; sth, The rest Tonic. There are many medicinal tonics offered to the :auhlic,but they may be classified oraler two heads :—The Bess and The Rest. GWILYM EVANS' QUININE /SIFTERS IS TOE BEST. Caution, beware of imitations. See that you get Gwilym Evans' Quinine Bitters, with the n, me " Gwilym Erans "on label, stamp, and bottle. Sold everywhere in bottles at 2s. 91. and 42. 61.. or in cases containing three 4*. 61. bottles at 121. 61. per Case. Should any difficulty be experienced in procuring it the Proprietors will forward for the above prices, carriage free. Sole Proprietors : Qainine Bitters Manufacturing Company, Limited, Llanelly, South Wales. GWILYM EVANS' QUININE BITtERS. GWILYIE EVANS' QUININE BITTERS, GIVILYISI EVANS' QUININE BITTERS.</p>
