        <p>Smoot. ATTENDANCE CARES. —For neglecting to send their children regnlarisr to school the following were dealt with:— James Bibby. 30. Croft-street, Crossley-street, fined 59.; Margaret nonnell, 9. Jockey-street. 2s. 64.; Willl.m Bilis. 50, 'Mewlis-street. adjourned ; Francis Rsaton 73, Scott- street. 2s. 64. ; Jame; MeKeen. 11. Albert-street, 21. 61.; Thomas Lawton. 10. Tilley-street. witharssm; Monagh An ,6, Annie-street. case dismissed. Orders to attend sshool and to par costs (2s. 6d.) were made on Jchn Hennaghan. 12, Backley-street: Thomas Jonost, 55, Long- shaw's-place, Folly-lane ; and William Lewis. 43,Laira-street.</p>
